<title>USA: SFS Bancorp sets five pct share buyback.</title>
<headline>SFS Bancorp sets five pct share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SCHENECTADY, N.Y. 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>SFS Bancorp Inc said on Wednesday that it intends to repurchase up to five percent of its outstanding shares in the open market.</p>
<p>These shares will be purchased at prevailing market prices from time to time depending on market conditions, SFS said.</p>
<p>Repurchased shares will become treasury shares and will be used for general corporate purposes, the company said.</p>
</text>
